# Backend — Basic

- Obey permanent defaults: `validation.mdc`, `database.mdc`, `restrictions.mdc`
- Authenticate then **authorize** on every protected endpoint
- No secrets in source — env + `.env.example`
- Consistent JSON success/error shapes when building APIs
- Log failures without passwords or tokens
- Implement only endpoints required by **concept-domain.mdc**
